<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">preservation-runes</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

A set of small rune-plates, each etched in a hand steadier than most and
warm faintly to the touch. Fitted to a thing at its finest moment, they
hold that moment fast -- the edge that will not dull, the color that
will not fade, the shape that refuses to remember it was ever anything
less. There is no decay in them, only the patient insistence that
perfection, once reached, need not be temporary.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting_circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Healer's Root (x2), Chrysalis Setting (x1), Binding Paste (x1)

